deepin-speedtest (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Spanish translation of the desktop app, the terminal mode and the
    launcher entry. Spanish is used when the system language is Spanish,
    English otherwise.
  * The window header no longer squeezes its buttons when labels are long.

