deepin-speedtest (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New Options window: choose the public server network (M-Lab or the
    LibreSpeed public servers) and a speed range of up to 5 Gbit/s.
  * LibreSpeed public servers: found from the project's server list, with
    the nearest ones picked automatically.
  * High-speed mode above 1 Gbit/s: wider dial, and more parallel
    connections and larger transfers for LibreSpeed tests.
  * About window: author line and a Credits tab.
  * The Start button is drawn by the app, removing the dark corners.

 -- RealAct <8281482+RealAct@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:15:00 +0000

deepin-speedtest (1.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix a crash when pressing "Start test" (a Qt signal was named "event",
    which shadowed QObject.event()).
  * An unexpected internal error no longer aborts the app.
  * Remove the focus frame around the tab buttons.

